{"headword":"אֲרִי","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.15\">Pr 28:15</a></sup> <strong>lion (</strong>Assyrian <em>aria</em>, Ethiopic አርዌ <em>wild beast</em>, cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְיֵה\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְיֵה\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְיֵה</a> infr.<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a> + 13 times + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.20\">2 S 23:20</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">אריה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.10\">La 3:10</a> (<em>id.</em>) + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:17\" href=\"/Psalms.22.17\">ψ 22:17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">כָּֽאֲרִי</span> for wh. read <span dir=\"rtl\">כארו</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּרוּ</span> cf. De Pe Che crit. note); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָיִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.20\">1 K 10:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָיוֹת</span> (also m.) <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.3\">Zp 3:3</a> + 16 times (f. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.38\">Je 51:38</a>? but cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:5\" href=\"/Judges.14.5\">Ju 14:5</a>);—<em>lion</em>, lit. in narrative <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:5\" href=\"/Judges.14.5\">Ju 14:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.34\">1 S 17:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.36\">36</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:37\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.20\">2 S 23:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.22\">1 Ch 11:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.25\">2 K 17:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.13\">Pr 22:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.13\">26:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.8\">Ct 4:8</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:19\" href=\"/Amos.5.19\">5:19</a>; <em>lion-images</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.29\">1 K 7:29</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.19\">10:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.20\">20</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.18\">2 Ch 9:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.19\">19</a>; in comparison <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:24\" href=\"/Numbers.23.24\">Nu 23:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:9\" href=\"/Numbers.24.9\">24:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.13\">Is 38:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.38\">Je 51:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.23\">2 S 1:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.25\">Ez 22:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.10\">La 3:10</a>; metaph. <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:12\" href=\"/Nahum.2.12\">Na 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.3\">Zp 3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.17\">Je 50:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.2\">Ez 19:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.6\">6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.15\">Pr 28:15</a>. For <span dir=\"rtl\">כארי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:17\" href=\"/Psalms.22.17\">ψ 22:17</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">כארו</span>, cf. above. Cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְיֵה\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְיֵה\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְיֵה</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB00817","strong_numbers":["738"],"next_hw":"אֻרְיָה","prev_hw":"אָרָה","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["787"],"TWOT":["158a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","la